# E-WasteTrace Rwanda

## Project Overview

E-WasteTrace Rwanda is a project designed to improve electronic waste management in Rwanda. It provides a system that helps users report electronic waste, manage collection activities, track waste, and promote proper recycling.

## Problem Statement

Improper disposal of electronic waste can cause environmental pollution and health problems. There is a need for a better system to manage and track electronic waste.

## Project Objectives

- To improve electronic waste collection in Rwanda.
- To help users report electronic waste.
- To track electronic waste from collection to recycling.
- To promote safe electronic waste disposal.
- To reduce environmental pollution.
